# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of local
# git config (core.autocrlf) or OS. This project's CI, pre-commit
# hooks, and prior CRLF-contamination fixes (see CHANGELOG.md) all
# assume LF. Without this file, a Windows dev machine with
# core.autocrlf=true will silently rewrite every staged file to
# CRLF, reintroducing the exact bug already fixed once.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch line endings in binary-ish or generated files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary